@dev Employs OpenZeppelin AccessControl for match lifecycle authorization and ReentrancyGuard
     for all state transitions and native MON currency transfers.

@notice Creates a new wager match for a specific track and list of participant addresses.
@param trackId bytes32 hash of the track identifier.
@param players List of racer addresses required to deposit.
@param wagerAmount Amount of native MON required from each racer.
@return matchId The created match unique identifier.

@notice Locks the match once all racers have deposited.
@dev Restricted to the REPORTER_ROLE. Transitions state to Locked.
@param matchId Identifier of the match.

@notice Reports final race finish order and pays out escrow pool to the winner.
@dev Restricted to the REPORTER_ROLE. Winner takes 100% of the pool (no rake in v1).
@param matchId Identifier of the locked match.
@param rankedPlayers Ordered list of finishers (first element is the winner).

@notice Allows any depositor to pull their wager back if match stalls past timeout.
@dev Prevents funds from being stuck if game crashes mid-race.
@param matchId Identifier of the match.

@title SmashToken ($SMASH)
@notice ERC-20 Reward and In-Game Utility Token for Monad SmashKarts
@dev Optimized for Monad Testnet with testnet faucet, gameplay rewards, and garage burning

